flowchart TD
  A[Branch passed its loop] --> L[Lock the target]
  L --> U[Merge the latest base into the branch]
  U --> C{Checks pass again?<br/>rungs 1-5, plus umbrella<br/>acceptance for pointers}
  C -- no --> BACK[Back to the loop]
  C -- yes --> H{Head is still the<br/>reviewed commit?}
  H -- no --> BACK
  H -- yes --> M[Merge pinned to the reviewed commit]
  M --> UN[Unlock and record in the ledger]
